# Don't send any particular file by default.
*

# Explicitly whitelist files relevant to image creation.
!deployment
!merlin-server/build/distributions/*.tar
!merlin-worker/build/distributions/*.tar
!scheduler-server/build/distributions/*.tar

# merlin-worker/Dockerfile and merlin-server/Dockerfile COPY these directly (roadmap
# §8.2 narrowed their build context from the monorepo root to plandev/ itself, which is
# what makes this .dockerignore apply to their builds at all for the first time -- under
# the old `context: ..`, Docker looked for a .dockerignore at the monorepo root, found
# none, and this file was never consulted).
!docker/graalpy
!merlin-server/constraints-dsl-compiler
